{
  "longTitle": "To make provision in connection with the giving of financial assistance in respect of the provision of infrastructure",
  "summary": "<p>The Bill allows the Government to provide financial assistance of up to &pound;50 billion in support of infrastructure investment. This limit could be increased by order. </p><p>The Government would have to report to Parliament at the end of each financial year on any commitments made under the Bill&rsquo;s provisions.</p>",
